admng-watchdog (@VERSION@) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Messages to users from AD Manager (AdMng 0.4.0): POST /api/v1/user-messages
    and GET /api/v1/user-messages/status for the Watchdog Admins and Viewers
    roles, configuration section userMessages (off by default, allowed
    senders, 300 per hour and 2000 per day), sent through the shared SMTP
    configuration and the outbox; message content is deleted once sent, the
    audit table user_messages (migration 0006, 365 days) holds no content.

 -- AD_MNG contributors <admng-watchdog@contoso.com>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

admng-watchdog (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release of AdMng Watchdog for Debian 12 and 13 (AdMng 0.3.0):
    systemd unit with notify and watchdog, journald logging, POSIX start-up
    checks, PEM certificate, Data Protection key ring under a systemd
    encrypted credential.
  * Service account ADMNG-WD$ with a keytab: admng-watchdog-keytab (init,
    rotate, verify, status) and the daily rotation timer (30 days).
  * WEF ingestion through admng-openwec, OpenWEC file rotation timer, GPO
    content tracking over SMB 3 (smbclient), Kerberos LDAP sign and seal.

 -- AD_MNG contributors <admng-watchdog@contoso.com>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
